1
00:00:00,671 --> 00:00:04,068
A downgrade. A missile strike. An inflation

2
00:00:04,068 --> 00:00:07,062
print that comes in hot. Markets react

3
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:09,434
to words, long before those words show

4
00:00:09,434 --> 00:00:10,299
