7
00:00:16,461 --> 00:00:18,268
all. And raw text can't feed a

8
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:20,979
model, a limit system, or a portfolio.

9
00:00:21,926 --> 00:00:24,741
This is RiskPulse. An AI and NLP

10
00:00:24,741 --> 00:00:27,550
risk engine that reads financial news and

11
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:30,735
social media, and turns every story into

12
00:00:30,735 --> 00:00:32,464
a structured risk signal.

13
00:00:33,393 --> 00:00:35,895
Here's how it works. A headline comes

14
00:00:35,895 --> 00:00:38,294
