37
00:01:35,814 --> 00:01:36,518
document.

38
00:01:37,525 --> 00:01:40,055
Module A is the tactical index rebalancer.

39
00:01:40,055 --> 00:01:43,032
Each stock's weight is its base weight

40
00:01:43,032 --> 00:01:46,416
times the exponential of its smoothed sentiment,

41
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:49,376
