42
00:01:49,376 --> 00:01:52,525
cap, and a ten percent turnover limit,

43
00:01:52,089 --> 00:01:54,566
so a single tweet can't swing the

44
00:01:54,566 --> 00:01:57,434
index. After the Strait tensions and the

45
00:01:57,434 --> 00:02:00,424
